B.ayA=new A.m8("Built-in","~1800 ELO","MIT","Pure Dart engine. Alpha-beta + TT + quiescence + reverse futility pruning + LMR. Works everywhere.",null)
B.ayE=new A.m8("Maia3 Dart","~1500-2500 ELO","AGPL-3.0 (weights)","Neural network trained on human games. ELO-conditioned: plays like a human at your rating. 3 model sizes (5M/23M/79M). 100% pure Dart, including a from-scratch ONNX interpreter \u2014 no third-party code runs, only original MIT code operating on downloaded weight data. The weights' upstream license is AGPL-3.0 \u2014 see THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md for details.",null)
B.ayC=new A.m8("ChessMamba","~800 ELO","MIT","By TobiasLogic. A selective state-space network (Mamba/S6) that reads the game as a sequence of moves, never the board, searched by its own policy-guided negamax. Games from the starting position only; others go to the built-in engine.",null)
B.ayy=new A.m8("Searchless 9M / 136M / 270M","up to ~2900 ELO","Apache-2.0 / CC BY 4.0",'DeepMind\'s "Grandmaster-Level Chess Without Search" transformers. No lookahead: the network judges every legal move once and plays the best. Weights CC BY 4.0, Google DeepMind.',null)
B.ayz=new A.m8("LM bot zoo","~400 ELO","MIT / Apache-2.0","Eight small chess language models from the Hugging Face Hub, each by its own author (see NOTICE.md). They read the game as text and choose among the legal moves only, so they never play an illegal move. Games from the starting position.",null)
B.ayx=new A.m8("Lc0","~1100-1900 ELO","GPL-3.0","MCTS + Maia neural network. AlphaZero-style search. Downloaded at runtime, never compiled into app.",null)
B.ayD=new A.m8("Frozenight","~3226 ELO","MIT / Apache-2.0","NNUE-based Rust engine. Compiled to WASM for web, native FFI for desktop/mobile.",null)
B.ayB=new A.m8("Stockfish","~2800-3400 ELO","GPL-3.0","Downloaded at runtime \u2014 never compiled into app. Runs as Web Worker or separate process. App stays MIT.",null)
